ategory_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"8FWAoGPBwRS3I7_FP7u-Mw","review_id":"4gXTX6KBrJ8blmXGkZ_foQ","date":"2020-09-15T15:42:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9486802220344543,"text_excerpt":"Nola Caye is definitely on my list for a revisit. The space was so beautiful and the music choice of soulful R&B was a huge check off on my list. It wasn't too loud just right. During my visit you had an option of indoor seating or outside which I really liked. Now on to the food. Y'all !! The crispy shrimp and chicken wings were the BOMB !! The sauce was sooo delicious and a must when you visit. The only down fall about my meal was the rice. It was on the harder side and not at flavorful as I had hoped, but it wasn't terrible and maybe that's how it was suppose to be made. I would get the roasted corn instead next time which was really good. The service was great and everyone was very ni..."},{"business_id":"8FWAoGPBwRS3I7_FP7u-Mw","review_id":"ZIfhssdZqjyJ9ofhq8Bc9w","date":"2021-06-21T17:35:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.948003351688385,"text_excerpt":"We had SUCH a good experience at Nola Caye! Everything (the food, service, drinks, ambiance) was great, but THE FOOD. So good. We ordered many different items and loved all of them. The tuna ceviche and the jalapeno grits were my favorite, with the shrimp curry being a close follow-up. Don't miss out on this place! We'll for sure be back soon."},{"business_id":"8FWAoGPBwRS3I7_FP7u-Mw","review_id":"RZ-M7BdexaTEVSPRdDJHlA","date":"2021-06-07T01:25:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.944359540939331,"text_excerpt":"Nola Caye is great! For starters, the ambiance is top tier. If you've seen a bit of my reviews, you know that I'm a sucker for beautiful interior design. Something about it just heightens the experience. As for the food, I highly recommend the crab and conch fritters. I'd seen other Yelpers rave about them and after trying them myself, I definitely see why. They are flavorful and touch all cylinders perfectly. As an entree, I had the red curry shrimp. It was really, really good! I have no complaints whatsoever. My companion had the tacos paired with rice and plantains. They reported that the tacos and rice were good but the plantains-- not so much. As someone who typically did not indulge..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"8FWAoGPBwRS3I7_FP7u-Mw","photo_id":"FxE1zmI1gFFB-flFt4dI9w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/FxE1zmI1gFFB-flFt4dI9w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8814224600791931},{"business_id":"8FWAoGPBwRS3I7_FP7u-Mw","photo_id":"hNgFy7Qsm1ZmK-vm4N-pZw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/hNgFy7Qsm1ZmK-vm4N-pZw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8700637817382812},{"business_id":"8FWAoGPBwRS3I7_FP7u-Mw","photo_id":"ziCTqOMZsRY-10K9XWStqw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ziCTqOMZsRY-10K9XWStqw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8699373602867126},{"business_id":"8FWAoGPBwRS3I7_FP7u-Mw","photo_id":"aHNXqvEJJay-J4Y0Zx9QyA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/aHNXqvEJJay-J4Y0Zx9QyA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.864206850528717},{"business_id":"8FWAoGPBwRS3I7_FP7u-Mw","photo_id":"31TXV4ryDD